{"parentUuid":"912f3fc4-0805-4a62-901d-fce587be9073","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"turn_duration","durationMs":41971,"messageCount":404,"timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:05:39.828Z","uuid":"e707863f-8aa2-41b9-a982-7aaf7b424395","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"e707863f-8aa2-41b9-a982-7aaf7b424395","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2b19b4a5-2606-4a2b-87c9-de896cbeb66e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Yeah, I mean, like, if you're, I mean, working within the workspace, especially, I mean, like, honestly, I'd love for people to be able to bring their agents into it and do and do stuff, but what we want to do is just have this boundary where we say, all right, this is like the safe space where we're collaborating as a global group, and this is the kind of like, you know, being exploited thing where we want to commercialize, where we want to charge for the degree of exploitation... I think that people who manufacture insight and feed it into the group should get compensated in some kind of way. And the way that I've thought about it is: if we have an API and people are using it, the cost of the API per credit is a count, you know, I mean, this should be in the central thing somewhere. Like, you know, there's some calculation about what we need to be sustainable as a firm, and plus a margin, plus a margin for them. And I think it should be basically like two margins: right? There's the firm margin, and then there's the network margin."},"uuid":"980b0d6f-eda0-4dd6-9404-9c1546793d58","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:07:18.404Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":107,"turnIndex":138},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
