{"parentUuid":"d3c25ba5-2238-47ba-87a1-20c98d7e7aa4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2b19b4a5-2606-4a2b-87c9-de896cbeb66e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019z8eyBGZH7DRNtBZC5GdwW","type":"tool_result","content":"praxis/lavender/rate-card.md\npraxis/pricing-alignment.md\n# Pricing and alignment (Sloane, 2026-10-13)\n\nWe manage money and take care of clients long term. Pricing exists to stay\naligned with them while funding the commons:\n\n1. Defray our own server infrastructure.\n2. Offset the cost of acquiring much more information.\n3. Validate it and make it public.\n4. Virtuous effect: public information improves the market we invest in.\n\nFiduciary objectivity follows from the same alignment: we hold opinions\n(including about vendors), evidenced and attributed, because our clients\nare owed judgment — not neutrality. See `pol-vendor-objectivity-001`.\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9ffd189a-bd6b-48b2-b809-54d0487d808c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:07:37.445Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"praxis/lavender/rate-card.md\npraxis/pricing-alignment.md\n# Pricing and alignment (Sloane, 2026-10-13)\n\nWe manage money and take care of clients long term. Pricing exists to stay\naligned with them while funding the commons:\n\n1. Defray our own server infrastructure.\n2. Offset the cost of acquiring much more information.\n3. Validate it and make it public.\n4. Virtuous effect: public information improves the market we invest in.\n\nFiduciary objectivity follows from the same alignment: we hold opinions\n(including about vendors), evidenced and attributed, because our clients\nare owed judgment — not neutrality. See `pol-vendor-objectivity-001`.","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2ef0ca3f-c070-4b35-9f07-7f266c41a2ac","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/s