{"parentUuid":"35968858-1771-4768-90a3-e6bb812af90b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b857ae61-b2ce-43be-a44a-1ed6ac2f9f63","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"I think people can bring their own agents into it within a tiny box, or within a scoped box, right? Like, we don't want to run the risk that that data gets exfiltrated via the agent route.... In terms of the mechanism of exploitation, I think it's a pretty straightforward thing. Why don't we look at the aggregate data spend on ESG data and whatnot, sustainability data by big third-party vendors, and then kind of translate that with, and then kind of figure out what percentage of that is directly associated with all these underlying nonprofits, you know, and then there we go. Also, if you're training in LLM, that's like that's classic, classical.... I mean, like, my thinking is: you know, it's an in-game-out-game, right? In the boundary, you can do it, but you can do whatever you want as long as you give it back and you leave the comments better than you found it... Or you create infrastructure, or you do things, or you take tasks. I mean, we should really be able to say, here are some tasks you can have."},"uuid":"2ffb671c-5237-41fd-ac2d-fdc18ba88729","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:11:15.739Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":108,"turnIndex":139},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"ec-ai-corpus","slug":"calm-crunching-lovelace"}
